  - m_Id: 1282400256
    m_Localized: Loading your latest career...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594560
    m_Localized: Something went wrong. Check the console.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594561
    m_Localized: Career session running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594562
    m_Localized: On Your Own
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594563
    m_Localized: Clean slate, no safety net.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594564
    m_Localized: You start unknown, underfunded, and free from baggage. Every bit
      of progress is yours to earn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594565
    m_Localized: Balanced baseline for a first career run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594566
    m_Localized: At Rock Bottom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594567
    m_Localized: Debt, hunger, and no stable home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594568
    m_Localized: You begin in survival mode and need fast cash before music can become
      more than a dream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594569
    m_Localized: Hardcore recovery route with the harshest early pressure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594570
    m_Localized: Privileged Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594571
    m_Localized: Money and access, little respect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594572
    m_Localized: Doors open faster, but everyone expects results and assumes you
      did not earn your shot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594573
    m_Localized: Safer economy with more social scrutiny.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594574
    m_Localized: One-Meme Wonder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594575
    m_Localized: A burst of hype with no foundation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594576
    m_Localized: People know your name for the wrong reason. You must convert attention
      into real fans before it fades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594577
    m_Localized: Volatile high-risk opening built around hype decay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594578
    m_Localized: Basement Genius
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594579
    m_Localized: Serious craft, weak stage presence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594580
    m_Localized: You already know how to make strong music, but performing, networking,
      and image are holding you back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594581
    m_Localized: Skill-forward opening with social weaknesses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594582
    m_Localized: Former Group Member
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594583
    m_Localized: An audience, a breakup, and messy history.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594584
    m_Localized: You leave a past collective with some fans and some enemies. Old
      rights and resentments still follow you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594585
    m_Localized: Starts with momentum and relationship complications.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594586
    m_Localized: "Prot\xE9g\xE9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594587
    m_Localized: A powerful mentor and a long shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594588
    m_Localized: An established artist backs you, giving access and pressure in equal
      measure. People compare every move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1286594589
    m_Localized: Advanced narrative start with inherited expectations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
